---
// What happens after a task once both opt-in checks are on: Vector does the task, LLM-as-a-judge checks it against
// the request (repairing for up to three rounds on a FAIL), then Vectorscope reviews the code and reports. With the
// judge off, the review follows the task directly. The homepage and the verified-completion docs both show it for the
// desktop setting Code review after each task in Settings → General. Their surrounding copy follows publication.
//
// It is markup, not a picture: three cards in an ordered list, so the words stay real text in reading order, with
// small decorative arrows between them. Its colours come from the page around it, the landing tokens on the homepage
// and the docs tokens in the docs. The site is dark only, so a light theme would only redefine those tokens. Wide, the
// cards sit in a row with the judge's repair loop drawn under them and the judge-off path above; narrow, they stack,
// the arrows turn downward and the judge-off path becomes a line of text under the first card.
interface Props {
  /** Unique on the page: the figure's id, and the prefix of its caption's. */
  id: string
  tone: "landing" | "docs"
}
---

<figure
  id={Astro.props.id}
  class:list={["rp", `rp-${Astro.props.tone}`]}
  role="group"
  aria-labelledby={`${Astro.props.id}-caption`}
>
  <div class="rp-flow">
    <div class="rp-bypass" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="rp-tag">Judge off: straight to review</span>
      <svg class="rp-bypass-head" viewBox="0 0 12 8" width="12" height="8" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M1.5 1.5 6 6.5l4.5-5"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <ol class="rp-steps" role="list">
      <li class="rp-step">
        <div class="rp-card">
          <div class="rp-card-head">
            <span class="rp-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="rp-title">Vector does the task</h3>
          <p class="rp-text">Makes the changes you asked for and tells you what it did.</p>
          <p class="rp-skip">Judge off? Step 2 is skipped.</p>
        </div>
        <svg class="rp-arrow" viewBox="0 0 40 16" width="40" height="16" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 8h34"></path>
          <path d="m31 3 5 5-5 5"></path>
        </svg>
      </li>

      <li class="rp-step">
        <div class="rp-card rp-optional">
          <div class="rp-card-head">
            <span class="rp-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
            <span class="rp-chip">If you turned it on</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="rp-title">LLM-as-a-judge checks</h3>
          <p class="rp-text">
            Compares the result with your request. On a FAIL, Vector repairs the work and the judge looks again, up to
            three rounds.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rp-loop" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="rp-loop-head" viewBox="0 0 12 8" width="12" height="8" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M1.5 6.5 6 1.5l4.5 5"></path>
          </svg>
          <span class="rp-tag">
            <svg class="rp-loop-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M13.5 8A5.5 5.5 0 1 1 11.9 4.1"></path>
              <path d="M12.4 1.6v2.9H9.5"></path>
            </svg>
            FAIL: repair, then judge again · up to 3 rounds
          </span>
        </div>
        <svg class="rp-arrow" viewBox="0 0 40 16" width="40" height="16" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 8h34"></path>
          <path d="m31 3 5 5-5 5"></path>
        </svg>
      </li>

      <li class="rp-step">
        <div class="rp-card">
          <div class="rp-card-head">
            <span class="rp-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="rp-title">Vectorscope reviews the code</h3>
          <p class="rp-text">
            Reviews your uncommitted changes once the work is done and reports its findings. It doesn't edit your
            files.
          </p>
          <p class="rp-end">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="m3.5 8.5 3 3 6-7"></path>
            </svg>
            Findings in Local reviews
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <figcaption id={`${Astro.props.id}-caption`} class="rp-caption">
    With both settings on, Vector finishes the task, the judge checks it, then Vectorscope reviews the code as the
    judge's last round left it. With the judge off, the review follows the task directly.
  </figcaption>
  <p class="rp-fine">
    Both checks are opt-in and off by default, and each one costs extra model calls. Code review needs Vectorscope
    local reviews turned on and covers all uncommitted changes in the repository, yours included. Greetings, questions,
    plan mode before you approve the plan, and tasks that change no files aren't reviewed.
  </p>
</figure>

<style>
  /* The page's own tokens: the landing ones on the homepage, the docs ones in the docs. */
  .rp {
    --rp-accent: var(--landing-accent, var(--d-accent));
    --rp-surface: var(--landing-surface, var(--dx-surface));
    --rp-line: var(--landing-line, var(--d-line-strong));
    --rp-title: var(--landing-title, var(--d-heading));
    --rp-text: var(--landing-secondary, var(--d-muted));
    --rp-ground: var(--page);
    --rp-dash: color-mix(in srgb, var(--rp-accent) 58%, transparent);
    --rp-gap: 56px;
    --rp-radius: 20px;
    /* The paths' ends sit under the middle of the first and last cards. */
    --rp-center: calc((100% - 2 * var(--rp-gap)) / 6);
    container-type: inline-size;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .rp-docs {
    --rp-gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .rp-flow {
    position: relative;
    padding: 64px 0 66px;
  }

  /* These out-specify the docs' own svg and h3 rules, since scoped styles add no specificity. */
  .rp .rp-flow svg {
    flex: none;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  /* ---- the cards ---- */

  .rp .rp-steps {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    column-gap: var(--rp-gap);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .rp .rp-step {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .rp-card {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 22px 22px 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    /* Opaque, so the page's moving backdrop stays behind the card. */
    background: linear-gradient(var(--rp-surface), var(--rp-surface)), var(--rp-ground);
    border: 1px solid var(--rp-line);
    border-radius: var(--rp-radius);
  }

  /* The judge is the step only some runs take. */
  .rp-card.rp-optional {
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--rp-dash);
  }

  .rp-card-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .rp-num {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: var(--rp-accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--rp-accent) 13%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--rp-accent) 36%, transparent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .rp-chip {
    padding: 4px 10px;
    color: var(--rp-accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--rp-accent) 10%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--rp-accent) 26%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .rp .rp-step .rp-title {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    color: var(--rp-title);
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.012em;
  }

  .rp .rp-text {
    max-width: none;
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    color: var(--rp-text);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  /* Said by the judge-off path above the row when it is wide; written out when the cards stack. */
  .rp .rp-skip {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    margin: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .rp .rp-end {
    margin: auto 0 0;
    padding-top: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--rp-title);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .rp-end svg {
    color: var(--success, var(--rp-accent));
  }

  /* ---- the arrows and the two dashed paths ---- */

  .rp-arrow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: calc(100% + (var(--rp-gap) - 40px) / 2);
    margin-top: -8px;
    color: var(--rp-accent);
  }

  .rp-tag {
    padding: 5px 12px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    color: var(--rp-title);
    background: var(--rp-ground);
    border: 1px solid var(--rp-line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.25;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* From the top of the first card, over the judge, down into the review. */
  .rp-bypass {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    left: var(--rp-center);
    right: var(--rp-center);
    height: 50px;
    color: var(--rp-dash);
    border: 1.5px dashed currentColor;
    border-bottom: 0;
    border-radius: 18px 18px 0 0;
  }

  .rp-bypass .rp-tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, calc(-50% - 0.75px));
  }

  .rp-bypass-head {
    position: absolute;
    right: -6.75px;
    bottom: 0;
    color: var(--rp-accent);
  }

  /* From under the judge back to Vector, which repairs and hands the work to the judge again. */
  .rp-loop {
    position: absolute;
    top: 100%;
    right: 50%;
    width: calc(100% + var(--rp-gap));
    height: 34px;
    color: var(--rp-dash);
    border: 1.5px dashed currentColor;
    border-top: 0;
    border-radius: 0 0 18px 18px;
  }

  .rp-loop .rp-tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: 100%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, calc(-50% + 0.75px));
  }

  .rp-loop-head {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: -6.75px;
    color: var(--rp-accent);
  }

  .rp-loop-icon {
    display: none;
    color: var(--rp-accent);
  }

  /* ---- caption and fine print ---- */

  .rp .rp-caption {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 8px auto 0;
    color: var(--rp-text);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .rp .rp-fine {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 12px auto 0;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--rp-text) 82%, transparent);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  /* ---- the docs column: smaller type ---- */

  .rp-docs .rp-card {
    padding: 18px 16px 16px;
  }

  .rp-docs .rp-step .rp-title {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .rp-docs .rp-text {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .rp-docs .rp-end {
    padding-top: 14px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
  }

  .rp-docs .rp-tag {
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }

  .rp-docs .rp-caption {
    font-size: 13.5px;
  }

  .rp-docs .rp-fine {
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  /* ---- narrow: the cards stack and the arrows point down ----
     Three cards in a row need about 860px of the figure; below that their text wraps word by word, so they stack.
     The docs column is always narrower than that. */

  @container (max-width: 859px) {
    .rp-flow {
      padding: 0;
    }

    .rp .rp-steps {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      row-gap: 48px;
    }

    .rp-landing .rp-steps {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .rp-bypass {
      display: none;
    }

    .rp-arrow {
      top: 100%;
      left: 50%;
      margin: 0;
      transform: translate(-50%, 16px) rotate(90deg);
    }

    .rp .rp-skip {
      position: static;
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      padding-top: 12px;
      overflow: visible;
      clip-path: none;
      color: var(--rp-title);
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--rp-dash);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.4;
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .rp-loop {
      position: static;
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
      margin-top: 14px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 0;
    }

    .rp-loop .rp-tag {
      position: static;
      transform: none;
      white-space: normal;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .rp-loop-head {
      display: none;
    }

    .rp-loop-icon {
      display: block;
    }

    .rp .rp-caption {
      margin-top: 28px;
    }
  }
</style>
